{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Zul'Gurub: High Priestess Mar'li hatches her eggs every 30 seconds in both forms on every difficulty",
  "contract": [
    "The Ascended kill video (youtube 6ihbw1PKc2E, 2026-08-04) shows a DBM Hatch Eggs bar that restarts at 30 s,",
    "and the tester saw the same on live Normal, in her spider form as well. Hatch Eggs (2118115) comes 17 s into",
    "the fight and every 30 s after, on Normal (template 14510) as on Ascended (raid difficulty 3, template",
    "314510). The Normal Mar'li is wounded below half health after her first hatch, so her spider form with its",
    "Furious Strikes (2118126 on her) must keep hatching; the Ascended one stays a troll. Each hero fights a",
    "Mar'li summoned in their own instance."
  ],
